      "normalized_sha256": "a4545b542cd0f8ff08024b166bf6bd722fa870b2dc67958768c7594c623b6919",
      "rationale": "Defines the negative-difference recurrence of expected by prepending the negated elementwise difference and recursing on both tails.",
